{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50700","headline":"寓居临平山下三首 · 张祜","name":"寓居临平山下三首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（按此第一首亦见《永乐大典》卷二二七一、七模、湖字临平湖条〖二函二十册〗。\n又清初沈谦《临平记》卷四亦载之。\n题曰《过临平湖》，即将两书异字校注於下。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}